Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:26.28,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}On and on the Great River rolls, racing east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.28,0:01:35.13,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Of proud and gallant heroes,\N its white waves leave no trace,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:44.71,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}as right and wrong, glory and fall,\N fade at once into nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.71,0:01:49.44,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yet ever the green hills stay,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:53.95,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}to blaze in the west-waning day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:06.26,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The white-haired fishermen and lumberjacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:10.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}on the river banks,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.46,0:02:18.68,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}looking on the autumn moons and spring breezes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.68,0:02:26.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}With a jar of wine, they gather in merriment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.94,0:02:30.04,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The countless tales of present and past,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.04,0:02:41.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}all in their jests!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.30,0:02:49.55,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}With a jar of wine, they gather in merriment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.55,0:02:52.56,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The countless tales of present and past,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.56,0:03:09.15,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}all in their jests!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.26,0:03:15.10,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,900,3350,4180)\pos(640,374.4)}Act 3
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.26,0:03:15.10,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,900,3350,4180)\pos(640,587.2)}Rise of the Three Kingdoms
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.74,0:03:21.22,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,50,500,4970,5240)\pos(640.155,425.455)}Episode 55\N\N\N\N\NThe Struggle for Succession
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:22.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.78,0:03:24.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cao Zhi, the Marquis of Lingzi,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.42,0:03:26.34,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and son of Cao Cao, the King of Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:30.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Oh? Cao Zijian, the man they call "The Savant of the World"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.44,0:03:31.54,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.34,0:03:40.50,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dǒu{\i0}（斗） and {\i1}dàn{\i0}（石）: Chinese units of volume. 1 {\i1}dǒu{\i0} = 10 {\i1}dàn{\i0} ≈ 104 liters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.74,0:03:35.12,Thinking,,0,0,0,,I've heard that should there be one dan of talent in under Heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:37.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,the Marquis could have eight {\i1}dou{\i0} for himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.54,0:03:40.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,with the last {\i1}dou shared among all other men of letters!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.62,0:03:43.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,-A genius!\N-Yes, a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:55.86,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Excerpt from Miscellaneous Poems of Seven {\b1}(雜詩七首){\b0}, no. 6 \Nby Cao Zhi
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:55.86,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I gaze afar a thousand {\i0}li,{\i1}\Nwhere dawn and dusk meet the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.22,0:04:00.58,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The bravest lie in agony,\Nthe lesser rests in leisure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.04,0:04:06.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}For Nation's rancor without calm,\NI give my head for its peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:14.06,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}With sword in hand I look southwest,\Nto see myself on Mount Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.08,0:04:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, good. Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.14,0:04:28.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(297.673,478.582)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.06,0:04:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, this is the new poem sent by Third Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.82,0:04:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Has the King of Wei raised the matter of appointing an heir?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.54,0:04:36.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(993.382,489.436)}Cáo Zhí\NStyled: Zǐjiàn
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.66,0:04:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Noble Childe, dare I to ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.98,0:04:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,upon accession to the throne someday, what his ambitions may be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:45.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(298.182,495.945)}Yáng Xiū \NStyled: Dézǔ
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.32,0:04:52.28,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Excerpt from {\i1}Letter to Yáng Dézǔ{\i0}（與楊德祖書), \Na historical letter by Cáo Zhí.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.32,0:04:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Should I get the opportunity, I would work diligently for the nation,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.46,0:04:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}and benefit the people to build an everlasting foundation,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.66,0:04:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}and leave a legacy like stone and metal, as a noble gentleman ought to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.54,0:05:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire's great talent and noble ambition are admirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.02,0:05:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish that Noble Childe's ambition could be realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.82,0:05:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.\NPlease.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.50,0:05:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}Poetry and odes need no mentioning,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.42,0:05:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}but Father recently asked me of current politics and military matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.60,0:05:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I do not take heed of these matters usually, \Nso I worry I cannot answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.38,0:05:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.58,0:05:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There will be no error, if you answer with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.62,0:05:55.07,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(902.4,81.6)}Ten Points,\N in Response to Questions{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.68,0:05:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Questions about current politics and military matters are all answered here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.06,0:06:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Noble Childe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.34,0:06:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that nobody knows more about a lord than his courtiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody knows more about my father than Dezu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, let me toast to you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Noble Childe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.42,0:06:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Recently, I heard lavish burials have become popular among the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.48,0:06:25.14,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: During the Han Dynasty, lavish funerals were commonplace, thus leading to greater number of tombs discovered, that are from the Han Dynasty
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.44,0:06:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}This should be forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.42,0:06:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.16,0:06:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Zhengli.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.46,0:06:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.36,0:06:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}You may draft the edict to be issued.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.42,0:06:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.54,0:06:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Your Highness, the edict for seeking merit has been drafted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.22,0:06:46.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(992.727,465.236)}Dīng Yí\NStyled: Zhènglǐ
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.02,0:06:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Concise in words and appealing to both reason and emotion. Excellent work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.94,0:06:58.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(304.945,463.582)}Wú Zhì\NStyled: Jìzhòng
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.58,0:07:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhengli.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.22,0:07:16.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(940.509,482.727)}Jiá Xǔ\NStyled: Wénhé
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, the edict for banning lavish burials, has been drafted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.46,0:07:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How quick your pen is, Zhengli!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.80,0:07:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please review it, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.54,0:07:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.14,0:07:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhengli, could it be that you already had a draft in your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.98,0:07:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness only just spoke of this, how could I know beforehand?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.84,0:08:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You wrote a thousand words in an instant,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.74,0:08:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and yet I cannot edit even one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.14,0:08:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A great talent!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.50,0:08:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.18,0:08:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,compared to the ability of Master Zijian,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,my talent is nothing but a sparrow next to a great {\i1}péng.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:14.74,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,{\i1}Péng:{\i0}（鹏） A legendary bird gigantic in size.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.34,0:08:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.16,0:08:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Brilliant and astute, \Nwhose writings are beyond compare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.00,0:08:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Among the great men of our age, \Nmany would give their lives for his ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.16,0:08:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}Truly a Heaven's gift upon the realm of Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.46,0:08:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I, too, love my son dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.38,0:08:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness' words follows the will of Heaven, attuned to the people's hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.74,0:08:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The court is fortunate, and the people under Heaven are fortunate!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.90,0:08:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you gentlemen think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.98,0:09:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Your Highness's familial matter, I dare not to say anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.22,0:09:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but this matter concerns the survival of the realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.70,0:09:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,so I have but a lesser thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no need to worry and say it, Zizhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.50,0:09:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Your Highness, in the past, \Nrelinquishing the elder to enthrone the young,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.40,0:09:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}has created many struggles between brothers which only brought chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.46,0:09:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Not to mention that Noble Childe Zihuan is of benevolent and filially pious nature,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.86,0:09:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}well-learned, and popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I hope that Your Highness can make a clear judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.32,0:09:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, you are dismissed for now. Allow me to consider.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.58,0:09:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.34,0:09:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.10,0:10:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.10,0:10:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,One case of {\i1}su.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please have a taste, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.10,0:10:10.46,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Sū or Sou (酥) is a type of Chinese flaky pastry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.74,0:10:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who sent this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.58,0:10:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,General of the Household for All Purposes searched for capable artisans,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.28,0:10:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,to make this like those from the north of the Great Wall, as a gift to Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.84,0:10:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only General of the Household earnestly respects sire,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:49.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,even we servants receive great care from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.26,0:10:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly befitting of your scion, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.62,0:10:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A sincere gentleman with unparalleled talent and virtue!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.68,0:11:26.35,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,{\b0}"One case of sū"{\b1}. Note: "合" can also mean "box/case" or a unit of dry measure in old Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.30,0:11:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.62,0:11:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,His Highness tasted the pastries,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.42,0:11:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and he greatly approved of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,In my opinion...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.98,0:11:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How has the Marquis of Lingzi been recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.54,0:12:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Registrar Yang Xiu wrote a...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.66,0:12:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...something called {\i1}Ten Points in Response to Questions{\i0} and gave it to Third Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.66,0:12:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ten Points in Response to Questions?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.86,0:12:09.66,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(314.255,491.382)}Cáo Pī\NStyled: Zǐhuán
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.62,0:12:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They do frequently converse for entire nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.26,0:12:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You must observe them carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.06,0:12:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That turtle of jade...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.86,0:12:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.94,0:12:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.54,0:12:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your command, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.06,0:12:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this belong to His Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.94,0:12:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.34,0:13:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why put it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.66,0:13:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,His Highness tasted it here last dusk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.94,0:13:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,His Highness was delighted by its taste, and ordered it be placed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.56,0:13:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps to enjoy it again after his tour of the garden today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.46,0:13:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-Go on then.\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.58,0:13:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.58,0:13:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,These pastries are quite delicious. Come and taste them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.70,0:13:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This item belongs to Father, how can we eat it without permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.58,0:13:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How is the taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.86,0:13:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It is exquisite.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it is fine to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.98,0:13:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.14,0:13:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come.\NNo, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.78,0:13:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhengli.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.02,0:14:01.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Dezu is the Registrar whom my father appreciates the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.14,0:14:03.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If he dares to eat, then what do we fear for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.42,0:14:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.14,0:14:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.30,0:14:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat.\NEat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.10,0:14:32.78,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Excerpt from Kōnghóu Play (箜篌引),\Nby Cáo Zhí
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.10,0:14:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Wine raised high at banquet hall,\Nwith kith and kin around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.66,0:14:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Kitchens hear the lavish call,\Nslaying sheep and fatted veal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.30,0:14:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Mighty is the Qin's cither!\NSoothing is the Qi's zithern.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.98,0:14:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yang'e gives dance most marvel,\Nfamous as the songs of Luò.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.98,0:14:57.66,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Yang'e(阳阿) likely refers to Zhao Feiyan, a beautiful singer and dancer born in Yang'e, who became an empress. "Luò" refers to Luò River
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.90,0:15:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}As emptied grails stack to three!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.66,0:15:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.96,0:15:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-Your Highness.\N-Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.34,0:16:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.94,0:16:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This was because of my gluttony...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.18,0:16:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do with Noble Childe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.62,0:16:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, we were following Your Highness's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.08,0:16:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Explain?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.70,0:16:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this not personally penned by Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.54,0:16:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.98,0:16:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,With Your Highness's clear orders here:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.18,0:16:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,"One mouthful of pastries per person."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.18,0:16:33.90,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: "合" is comprised of characters for "人" (person), "一" (one) and "口" (mouth), hence the wordplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we disobey Your Highness's orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.22,0:16:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Dezu's wonderful thoughts and smarts,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.48,0:16:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,are truly unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.52,0:17:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, you have done me too much honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.42,0:17:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sirs, if you have no other affairs, you are dismissed for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.10,0:17:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.44,0:17:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not mingle with Yang Xiu and Ding Yi too much. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.10,0:17:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.94,0:17:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, His Highness orders that Master enter the palace at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.46,0:17:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.52,0:18:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,His Highness wishes to test the two Noble Childes on current politics and military matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.14,0:18:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijian,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.10,0:18:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Zihuan is no match for you when it comes to poetry and odes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.66,0:18:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but today, I test your knowledge on current state affairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.08,0:18:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you may be at a disadvantage now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.02,0:18:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.66,0:18:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,that may have been the case in the past, \Nbut not today necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.10,0:18:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold the boasting and listen to my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.74,0:18:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.30,0:18:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I, by sacred Imperial decree, carry a sword \Nand wear shoes when entering the palace hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.30,0:18:53.30,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Ministers are normally not allowed to wield swords \Nand wear shoes during emperor's audience, as shown in episode 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.54,0:18:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Today, however, someone says that when entering the Ancestral Temple, shoes should be taken off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.82,0:19:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}Question: If I wish to enter the Ancestral Temple,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.24,0:19:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}should I take the shoes off or keep them on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.46,0:19:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.62,0:19:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Father should wear shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.06,0:19:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.20,0:19:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Should shoes be taken off, it would be respecting the ancestors, yet defying imperial orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.10,0:19:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}honoring the forefathers, \Nbut wronging the monarch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.22,0:19:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Confucius has saith: "I continue to bow below\N the hall, though I oppose the common practice."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:30.26,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Analects{\i0} 9-3. Translation by James Legge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.72,0:19:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}How honest these words are!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.00,0:19:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}I wonder if Father believes this is correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.22,0:19:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that nobody knows more about a man more than his father,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.62,0:19:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but Zijian's talent is beyond me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.06,0:19:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Zihuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.62,0:19:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,politics and military matters had been in your province,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.54,0:19:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but you failed to match Zijian today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.10,0:20:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be more diligent from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.98,0:20:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, well said.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.86,0:20:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My talents have never been able to match those of Zijian,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.42,0:20:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and now I failed to study diligently. \NFrom here on, I will put in more effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.02,0:20:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you, go and rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.34,0:20:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.94,0:20:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder brother, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.14,0:20:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother, please go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.50,0:20:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, please go first!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother won and deserves to be in the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.02,0:20:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.98,0:20:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not expect that Third Brother would gain the upper hand again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.10,0:20:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking at Father's mood now,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.70,0:21:03.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,if he enthrones the young instead of the elder, what then?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.66,0:21:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I have tried to advise otherwise, but His Highness did not listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.98,0:21:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It is my fault for not being convincing enough to His Highness,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.50,0:21:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed to live up to Noble Childe's trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.06,0:21:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What can be done now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.14,0:21:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}Palace Counsellor Jia Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.72,0:21:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}though he says nothing, I think he has his heart on Noble Childe's side!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.96,0:21:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}This man is wily and sly,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.84,0:21:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}he has always been well regarded by His Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.74,0:21:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}If he is willing to put in a good word for Noble Childe,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.02,0:21:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}then success can be guaranteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.74,0:21:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}Jia Xu...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.64,0:22:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}An esteemed guest today may become a prisoner tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.60,0:22:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Though I am not one of \NKing of Wei's most veteran subordinates,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.94,0:22:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}I accompany His Highness often, nevertheless.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.48,0:22:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}His Highness heeds my words, and I have been held in regard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.70,0:22:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}This has attracted envy and hatred.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.42,0:22:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\}If no discretion is to be made, disaster will certainly come.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.86,0:22:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}With my talent, I could make allies from everywhere easily,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.40,0:22:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}but I've lived in recluse for all these years, I seek not from high places,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.46,0:22:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}and make no relations \Noutside of public affairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.92,0:22:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}all to avoid misfortune for my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.70,0:22:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Grandfather-!\N-Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.30,0:22:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.58,0:22:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.60,0:22:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,General of the Household for All Purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.22,0:23:05.38,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(363.273,421.364)}Jiǎ Mó
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.54,0:23:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandfather, I will tell them you had just gone to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.46,0:23:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.08,0:23:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand down for now, I will meet with him after I change.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.14,0:23:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Counsellor Jia!\N-Noble Childe!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.94,0:23:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Please sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.26,0:23:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what your bidding is, arriving deep into the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.54,0:23:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me, Counsellor Jia!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.90,0:23:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Noble Childe, please rise, Noble Childe!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.66,0:23:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Should Noble Childe have any command, say it by all means.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.14,0:23:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I bear such a great courtesy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.46,0:23:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}With the lesson of humility that Counsellor had taught me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.50,0:23:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}I have moved Father's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.62,0:23:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}For this, I remain grateful to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.32,0:24:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Recently, I see based on my father's speech and expression,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.48,0:24:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}that he wishes to enthrone \Nthe young instead of the elder.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.38,0:24:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}I invited Wu Jizhong to discuss a countermeasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.96,0:24:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}I worried it might draw suspicion,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.22,0:24:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}so I tried this afternoon to bring Wu Jizhong to my residence in secrecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.22,0:24:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.28,0:24:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.20,0:24:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}The information was leaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.06,0:24:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}Father, greatly angered,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.14,0:24:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}has ordered a colonel of the Tiger Guards, \Nto set up patrols outside my manor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.70,0:24:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}This matter will certainly cause Father to resent me,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.50,0:24:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}solidifying his will of selecting Zijian.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.06,0:24:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}Please save me, Counselor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.32,0:24:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}Once my wish comes true,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.10,0:24:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}I will reward you greatly!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.50,0:24:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}Noble Childe, please rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.80,0:24:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Does Noble Childe know who leaked this matter to His Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.30,0:24:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}Yang Xiu, the Registrar.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.12,0:25:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}May I ask Sire, how Wu Jizhong was snuck into the manor?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.38,0:25:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}In a basket of bamboo, covered with brocade and carried by cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.68,0:25:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}If this is the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.46,0:25:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Noble Childe could command someone to bring in another cart of brocade.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.98,0:25:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.58,0:25:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-What is in the box?\N-Brocades.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.62,0:25:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Belonging to General of \Nthe Household for All Purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.20,0:25:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Search.\N-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.18,0:25:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, this is for the General of the Household!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.46,0:25:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.42,0:26:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Colonel, there's only brocade inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.18,0:26:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}Reports from Hanzhong say,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.80,0:26:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}that Liu Bei sent Zhang Fei and Ma Chao to garrison Xiaban,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.06,0:26:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}in order to invade Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.62,0:26:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I have ordered Cao Hong to lead fifty thousand troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.68,0:26:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}to assist Xiahou Yuan and Zhang He in defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.50,0:26:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}You know only of literary matters and not of the military,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.40,0:26:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}this ill fits a great man's character.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.22,0:26:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I hereby appoint you as Army Censor, \Naccompanying Cao Hong to Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.50,0:26:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}Are you willing to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.26,0:26:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}I am willing to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.70,0:26:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}On this trip, you must be diligent and careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.54,0:26:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Do not act without moderation, it will hamper major matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.46,0:27:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}At home, we are father and son, \Nbut in public, we are sovereign and vassal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.18,0:27:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The military law is merciless. You must remember that!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.06,0:27:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall follow Father's teachings.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.98,0:27:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to your mother's residence, bid farewell to her, and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.38,0:27:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I hereby bid farewell to Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.70,0:27:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.78,0:27:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.82,0:27:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,on Your Highness's orders, I stood guard at the manor of the General of the Household.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.52,0:27:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What anomalies have there been?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.78,0:27:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There have been no anomalies,\Nonly a single cart entered the residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.18,0:27:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you search it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.96,0:27:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It was searched, there was nothing else but brocades in the cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.82,0:27:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The escort said that there had been two carts \Nsent recently, and that one more cart is to be sent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.42,0:27:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Have the patrols dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.44,0:28:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.16,0:28:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}Zijian and Zihuan are both my sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.08,0:28:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}You value Zijian and despise Zihuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.38,0:28:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}to the point that you accused him for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.12,0:28:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}Is that not stepping out of bounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.82,0:28:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Your Highness-
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.06,0:28:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Jia Wenhe is wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.70,0:28:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yang Xiu was reprimanded by His Highness and left in shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.30,0:28:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How is the Marquis of Lingzi?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.10,0:28:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,His Highness appointed the Marquis of Lingzi as Army Censor,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.30,0:28:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and ordered him to go to Hanzhong with Cao Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.98,0:28:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They will set off tomorrow morning, at the hour of {\i1}Mao.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.98,0:28:52.90,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Hour of {\i1}Mǎo:{\i0}（卯） 5-7 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.94,0:29:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to the palace and invite the Marquis of Lingzi to my manor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.90,0:29:07.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I will send the Marquis of Lingzi off in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.14,0:29:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.14,0:29:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That is yours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.42,0:29:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This trip of Younger Brother's will be long, with the date of return uncertain.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.22,0:29:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,When we brothers will reunite is unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.98,0:29:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I raise a toast for Younger Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.14,0:29:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Elder Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.20,0:29:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Younger Brother's great talent is clearly beyond my reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.98,0:29:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish Younger Brother great success.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.02,0:29:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Please.\N-Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.34,0:30:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,On the day of Younger Brother's triumphant return,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.54,0:30:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I will recommend father to make Younger Brother as heir apparent,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.08,0:30:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,to succeed father's great enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.06,0:30:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Younger Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.90,0:30:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.18,0:30:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that Elder Brother is envious of my talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.02,0:30:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I know of Elder Brother's honest heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.26,0:30:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never forget Elder Brother's love.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.74,0:31:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Younger Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.10,0:31:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Another cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.38,0:31:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Younger Brother, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.98,0:31:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.90,0:31:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Younger Brother, eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.30,0:31:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, it is now the hour of {\i1}Mao.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.38,0:32:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The army is ready, but the Marquis of Lingzi is nowhere to be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.98,0:32:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Attendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.50,0:32:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.38,0:32:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go summon the Marquis of Lingzi and have him come and see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.10,0:32:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.26,0:32:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I exhorted again and again yesterday, and he still bungled this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.38,0:32:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Marquis of Lingzi?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.62,0:32:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.98,0:32:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.14,0:32:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, the Marquis of Lingzi...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.46,0:32:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.56,0:33:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marquis of Lingzi got drunk last night and is still asleep. I was unable to wake him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.98,0:33:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-Go.\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.06,0:33:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.26,0:33:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This matter is urgent. You will have to lead the troops out by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.18,0:33:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.86,0:33:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.46,0:33:34.08,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}This son is gifted and greatly perceptive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.30,0:33:38.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yet he still only relies on his gifts and does whatever he wishes. He is unfit to lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.42,0:34:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I have obtained an object, and it seems to be extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.34,0:34:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I ask father to view it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.18,0:34:14.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(769.6,510.4)}Ten Points\N in Response to Questions{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.78,0:34:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijian!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.94,0:34:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Zijian!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.30,0:34:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.62,0:34:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijian is young and ignorant.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.30,0:34:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that Father can forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.82,0:34:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all Yang Xiu's sinister work, trying to fool Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.66,0:34:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yang Xiu.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.54,0:34:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Zihuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.78,0:34:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.98,0:35:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Counsellor Jia.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.42,0:35:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Noble Childe.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.66,0:35:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.94,0:35:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What is Your Highness's bidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.06,0:35:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}Jia Xu, out of my sons,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.38,0:35:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}only Zihuan and Zijian are the most able.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.36,0:35:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}In your opinion, whom should I appoint as heir,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.24,0:35:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}to inherit the great enterprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.66,0:35:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}Hm? Why do you not answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.50,0:35:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}Oh! Forgive me, Your Highness,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.24,0:36:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}I was deep in thought, so I did not answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.18,0:36:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}What were you thinking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.94,0:36:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}Thinking about Yuan Benchu and Liu Jingsheng,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.50,0:36:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}who chose the younger son as heir,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.94,0:36:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,663)}leading to brothers attacking each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.14,0:36:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.42,0:36:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,... truly are a man of deep thought and cunning!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.10,0:37:10.54,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In the 22nd year of the Jian'an era (217 CE),
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.90,0:37:13.34,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cao Pi had finally defeated Cao Zhi,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.44,0:37:16.28,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and was made the heir apparent to the King of Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.82,0:37:26.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Wakou Pass was the only way of passage when conquering Hanzhong,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.52,0:37:30.22,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and is also the location of the supply depot of Xiahou Dun of the Cao army.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.02,0:37:35.98,Thinking,,0,0,0,,On Liu Bei's orders, Zhang Fei garrisoned in Baxi, \Nin order to advance onto Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.50,0:37:38.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,If Wakou Pass was conquered,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.86,0:37:42.58,Thinking,,0,0,0,,then the Cao army could not gain a foothold in Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.66,0:37:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.98,0:38:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, Strategos.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.40,0:38:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang He is leading fifteen thousand troops to attack Baxi, traveling day and night.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.86,0:38:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.34,0:38:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.14,0:38:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang He is well-beloved by Cao Cao, he is valiant and resourceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.04,0:38:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yide has no more than ten thousand troops under his command.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.36,0:38:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How can he subdue the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.82,0:38:28.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(321.091,509.982)}Zhūgě Liàng\NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.66,0:38:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to worry, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.70,0:38:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Third General is not what he used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.14,0:38:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I expect that he has a plan to defeat the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.90,0:38:38.70,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(302.036,495.836)}Liú Bèi\NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.02,0:38:43.22,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao, in order to gain a foothold in Hanzhong,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.38,0:38:47.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,sent senior general Zhang He to fight Zhang Fei.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.02,0:38:52.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(292.291,506.982)}Zhang Fei\NStyled: Yide
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.14,0:38:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang He!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.30,0:38:58.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(976.436,458.182)}Zhāng Hé
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.50,0:38:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and meet your death!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.18,0:39:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Fei, you baseborn, I will obliterate you! En-garde!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.26,0:39:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Report! Zhang Fei is shouting curses below the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.64,0:40:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He shouts that the General is cowardly and dares not to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.30,0:40:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him shout.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.22,0:40:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare more logs and stones, keep defending the fort.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.14,0:40:14.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No matter how Zhang Fei curses,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.44,0:40:17.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,nobody engage him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.58,0:40:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse! Curse them!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.18,0:40:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.94,0:40:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.90,0:40:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang He, you bastard,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.46,0:40:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.46,0:40:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Fei, you baseborn,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.34,0:40:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter how you curse, I will not leave the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.86,0:40:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse! Keep on cursing!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.70,0:40:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Coward Zhang He,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.22,0:40:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,so cowardly that you dare not come down!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.74,0:40:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse, curse! Keep cursing!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.26,0:41:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With Yide drinking all day, \Nhe will make a grave mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.16,0:41:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The camps might not have good wine, \Nbut Chengdu is stocked with great wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.02,0:41:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We can send someone there with a couple dozen urns,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.94,0:41:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,so that General Zhang may drink to his heart's content.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.30,0:41:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother has blundered much by drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.62,0:41:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you gift wine to him, Strategos?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.10,0:41:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord and Yide have been brothers for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.12,0:41:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you not know his character?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.18,0:41:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yide is staunch in nature, but when entering the Western Riverlands,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.90,0:41:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,he had abstained from alcohol and justly released Yan Yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.30,0:41:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are not what a boorish man would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.24,0:41:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Yide and Zhang He have been standing off for more than a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.88,0:41:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang He has not left his fortifications.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.26,0:42:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yide's drinking and cursing below the mountain every day,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.50,0:42:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,that is not just indulgence,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.54,0:42:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but strategy to lure Zhang He out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.54,0:42:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.62,0:42:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-General Zhang\N-You have done well.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.90,0:42:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,On the lord's order, I bring fifty urns of fine wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.46,0:42:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.42,0:42:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.02,0:42:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.62,0:42:42.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(309.455,495.709)}Wèi Yán\NStyled: Wéncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.50,0:42:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother and Strategos don't let me abstain, but now urge me to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.98,0:42:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a first!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.60,0:42:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.02,0:42:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink, all, drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.04,0:42:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,General, the instruments are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.64,0:43:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.46,0:43:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't General order that music be played every day, to urge Zhang Fei to keep on drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.02,0:43:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Call it off.\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.20,0:43:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, send in a spy and have him change to the uniform of Zhang Fei's army.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.86,0:43:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.\NYes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.94,0:43:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to find such good wine in the camps.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.54,0:43:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all drink to our heart's content!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.94,0:43:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang He is too terrified to do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.06,0:43:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Pitiful cowards the rest of them also!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.98,0:43:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink, drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.66,0:43:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink, drink for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.14,0:43:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You two lead a detachment \Nas left and right wings each.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.82,0:43:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you see the red flag, begin the attack. \NIntercept Zhang He's troops at their flanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.26,0:43:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.50,0:43:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,General, the wine was sent by Liu Bei. Zhang Fei ordered the entire camp to drink for three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.82,0:43:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.12,0:44:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Fei personally ordered them to indulge, they are defenseless with no will to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.86,0:44:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Fei, you bastard! You dare mock me!

